precipitarla nel rifiuto delle sue responsabilità di madre. L’intera adolescenza di Rebecca sarà segnata dalla vergogna e dal desiderio di nascondersi dagli altri. Ma fin da piccola rivela straordinarie capacità musicali. La zia Erminia riconosce il suo talento: Rebecca diventa sua allieva e il bisogno di cancellare la “macchia” la spingerà ad affermarsi attraverso la musica."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Life Apart","overview":"In Vicenza, a beautiful Italian art city, a young wealthy couple joyfully welcomes the birth of a long-awaited daughter in the early 1980s. But the child’s face is disfigured by a red birthmark that covers half her face. This spot haunts the mother to the point that she rejects her responsibilities as a mother. The child’s aunt, a famous concert pianist, takes over her education, thus discovering her exceptional musical talent."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Ll7ODwVvNSusauWb4ysI6r3hcR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Ll7ODwVvNSusauWb4ysI6r3hcR.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cDPr1G2Wsh1Ejnk1f3L885ptsrs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cDPr1G2Wsh1Ejnk1f3L885ptsrs.jpg","language":"it","width":762,"height":1143},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cDri1FZ4UXCKuyPOMiDnV9jkCVE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cDri1FZ4UXCKuyPOMiDnV9jkCVE.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iVWRgIAZdEyTo2HJROyekk6J40C.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iVWRgIAZdEyTo2HJROyekk6J40C.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x3uHWArlXf1tQdWK1i4kTKVe5yQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x3uHWArlXf1tQdWK1i4kTKVe5yQ.jpg","language":"en","width":1750,"height":2500},{"type":"poster"